# A guest throws a rock at a mannequin the host walks across its line, at 200 ms. The guest sees
# the walker a one-way trip and a playback delay late; the throw aims where its copy crosses.
scenario throw_walker
scene walker_lane
guests 1
settle 8s

net g1 rtt 200ms jitter 20ms loss 2%

p1 grab rock as lift
at 3300ms p1 throw 2.5 0.9 0 speed 10 as throw

expect result lift granted
expect result throw done
expect effect walker
expect effects_once
expect claims.count >= 1
expect claim_effects.count >= 1
expect claims_format.count <= 0
# Derived as in layer_bounce: float noise, 1 cm.
expect local_correction.max <= 1cm
# Derived: the stand takes the thrown body's pose at the throw's first tick; one step at a throw's
# speed (7 m/s and up: 12 cm) carries it past the 5 cm a move needs, and the seam never holds a
# body its thrower simulates: 1.
expect own_ticks.max <= 1t
expect agree_at_rest 5cm 5deg
expect no_stuck
